    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe aebele Mose ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Landa ku bena Israeli, ubebe auti, nga mwaingila mu calo ndi nokumupeela pakuti emo mukaleikala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mukaletuula Yawe amalambo yakoca ukufuma pa ŋombe nangu pa mukuni, ukuba icena cisuma icakusekesha Yawe, nangu umutuulo wakoca nangu amalambo ya pa mulandu wa filayo nangu aya bupe bwakuitemenwa, nangu imituulo ya pa nshikunkulu shenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo uyo onse uwatuula umutuulo kuli Yawe, ali nokubikapo umutuulo wa bunga bwa ŋanu ubwapeleka bwino icapekumi cimo ca ku cipimo ca efa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15:4,6,9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Efa:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cipimo ca fintu ifishili fya menshi ifyafina amakilo ikumi limo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", ubwasanshiwamo ne cipimo ca pakati ka citika wa hini",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15:4,5,6,7,9,10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Hini:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cipimo ca fya menshi menshi ifyalingana na balita bane.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wa mafuta ya miolifa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atuule ne cipimo ca pakati ka citika wa hini wa mwangashi ngo mutuulo wa cakunwa ukulunda pa mutuulo na pelambo lyakoca ilya cila mwana wa mpaanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pali sukusuku umo muli nokutuula umutuulo wa cabunga bwa ŋanu ubwapeleka bwino utwapekumi tubili twa ku cipimo ca efa, ifyasanshiwamo ne cipimo mupepi na citika wa hini wa mafuta ya miolifa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atuule no mwangashi icipimo mupepi na citika wa hini ngo mutuulo wa cakunwa. Fituulwe ukuba icena cisuma icakusansamusha Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga mwapekanya iŋombe ilume ngo mutuulo wa cakoca nangu ilambo, pa mulandu wa mulapo nangu mutuulo wakwampana kuli Yawe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pa ŋombe muli nokulundapo umutuulo wa cabunga bwa ŋanu ubwapeleka bwino utwapekumi tutatu twa ku cipimo ca efa, ubwasanshiwamo ne cipimo ca citika wa hini wa mafuta ya miolifa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili ali nokuleta umutuulo wa cakunwa icipimo ca citika wa hini wa mwangashi pakuba umutuulo wakoca pa mulilo kukuba icena cisuma icakusansamusha Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi uyu e musango wakupekanishishamo cila iŋombe, sukusuku na kana ka mpaanga nangu aka mbushi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inama shakutuula ilambo nangu shingafula shani, mukalecita ifyo fine kuli cila imo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onsefye umukaya umwina Israeli ali nokucita ifi fintu pakuleta umutuulo wakoca pa mulilo, kukuba icena cisuma icakusansamusha Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.49"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ukuf 12:49",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.24.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Levi 24:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.15.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Imp 15:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.15.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.15.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa mulandu wa nkulo shikesa, ilyo umwinafyalo nangu uuli onse uwikala na imwe atuula umutuulo wakoca pa mulilo, uwakuba icena cisuma icakusansamusha Yawe, nao wine afwilefye ukucita cimo cine ifyo na imwe mucita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwe bena Israeli, pamo pene na benafyalo abo mwikala nabo, ili lifunde lyamuyayaya ilyo mukalakonka mu nkulo shikakonkapo. Imwe na benafyalo, mukabafye cimo cine pa cinso cakwa Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amafunde ne fipope fikaba fimo fine kuli imwe na ku benafyalo abo mwikala nabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
